159
00:13:12,510 --> 00:13:15,650
Yeah. Eiji-kun probably picked the name.

160
00:13:15,650 --> 00:13:16,780
Serial Mama...

161
00:13:16,780 --> 00:13:21,420
A year ago, Eiji-kun said he was
gonna make the ultimate band.

162
00:13:21,420 --> 00:13:22,820
-The "ultimate band"?
-The "ultimate band"?

163
00:13:22,820 --> 00:13:26,990
