171
00:13:50,250 --> 00:13:52,150
Don't worry about 'em.

172
00:13:53,290 --> 00:13:57,960
Two opposites with perfect techniques
combine to create that sound!

173
00:13:57,960 --> 00:14:01,760
Those two lead guitars...
Man, talk about music!

174
00:14:01,760 --> 00:14:05,460
Serial Mama...They are the best!

175
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:10,140
Oh, they're up.

176
00:14:10,140 --> 00:14:11,970
Let's go up closer!

177
00:14:36,100 --> 00:14:37,530
Yay!

178
00:14:37,530 --> 00:14:41,160
Eiji! I love you!

179
00:14:47,710 --> 00:14:49,210
Yahoo!

180
00:14:49,210 --> 00:14:52,110
We're the Serial Mama!

181
00:15:01,390 --> 00:15:03,820
Hey! That's weird!

182
00:15:03,820 --> 00:15:08,090
