185
00:15:16,370 --> 00:15:21,410
Boy, that was a shock.
Does this happen often?

186
00:15:21,410 --> 00:15:25,680
A guitar string will break sometimes.

187
00:15:25,680 --> 00:15:29,520
But something this bad never happens.

188
00:15:29,520 --> 00:15:31,850
What a day for it to happen...

189
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:42,300
Can you connect the guitar line to C1?

190
00:15:42,300 --> 00:15:45,130
Got it!

191
00:15:45,130 --> 00:15:47,770
My shield is fine.

192
00:15:47,770 --> 00:15:50,300
Not mine. It's broken.

193
00:15:50,300 --> 00:15:53,210
I'll switch it!

194
00:15:53,210 --> 00:15:59,370
-How long's it gonna take?!
-Hurry it up!

195
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:07,390
I got it. The effecter volume was too low.

196
00:16:07,390 --> 00:16:08,980
Eiji!

197
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:12,620
Yo! I'm okay on my side!

198
00:16:18,770 --> 00:16:22,860
Thank you for your patience! Let's go!

199
00:16:33,250 --> 00:16:36,410
You're the best!

200
00:16:41,260 --> 00:16:42,690
Huh?

201
