at a pub up the street.

202
00:17:10,220 --> 00:17:13,020
-Won't you join us, Koyuki?
-Yeah.

203
00:17:13,020 --> 00:17:15,550
Hey, Izumi-chan, are your ears okay?

204
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:19,960
Oh, that's right. It was your
first time at a live concert.

205
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:23,860
Don't worry. Your hearing
will return in a bit.

206
00:17:23,860 --> 00:17:25,700
I'm going to call home.

207
00:17:25,700 --> 00:17:27,500
We'll go on ahead.

208
00:17:27,500 --> 00:17:28,070
"Pub New Shinshu"

209
00:17:28,070 --> 00:17:30,970
"Pub New Shinshu"

210
00:17:28,070 --> 00:17:30,970
-Okay, three orders of chuhai.
-Hey, gimme some beef tongue.

211
00:17:30,970 --> 00:17:34,840
"Pub New Shinshu"

212
00:17:30,970 --> 00:17:34,840
Hey, Eiji-kun and Ryusuke haven't
exchanged a word since the fight.

213
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:36,910
Hey, Eiji-kun and Ryusuke haven't
exchanged a word since the fight.

214
00:17:36,910 --> 00:17:41,140
Geez...This band is really in trouble.

215
00:17:43,550 --> 00:17:47,020
