216
00:17:47,020 --> 00:17:51,360
The Eiji and Ryusuke duo
will be together forever!

217
00:17:52,930 --> 00:17:54,550
I'm going to the john.

218
00:17:56,330 --> 00:17:58,260
This is the pits!

219
00:18:10,140 --> 00:18:15,240
Say, this is the toilet, right?

220
00:18:16,220 --> 00:18:19,340
Oh, you're Ryusuke-kun's younger sister.

221
00:18:20,820 --> 00:18:25,160
-Is this the toilet?
-Yeah, I think so.

222
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:26,130
Thanks.

223
00:18:26,130 --> 00:18:30,630
Oh, I see. Maho-chan,
you're not good with kanji either.

224
00:18:30,630 --> 00:18:32,570
What?!

225
00:18:32,570 --> 00:18:35,130
Who the fuck are you?!

226
00:18:38,940 --> 00:18:40,200
Idiot.

227
00:18:41,210 --> 00:18:43,480
Dammit!

228
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:50,420
-You wench!
-You got Serial Mama all wrong!

229
00:18:50,420 --> 00:18:52,590
Where's the sake?! Bring the sake!

230
00:18:52,590 --> 00:18:55,750
-Shut up!
-Screw you!

231
00:19:02,030 --> 00:19:04,630
Pankration began in ancient Greece,

232
00:19:04,630 --> 00:19:07,870
and in modern England, it became
popular as the Lancashire style

233
