And many wrestlers
have come up the ranks

235
00:19:13,540 --> 00:19:15,880
after going through
the notorious Snake Pit.

236
00:19:15,880 --> 00:19:18,280
And famous among them is Karl Gotch.

237
00:19:20,310 --> 00:19:24,590
