239
00:19:26,790 --> 00:19:29,360
Ryusuke-kun is really something.

240
00:19:29,360 --> 00:19:30,920
Yeah.

241
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:34,290
I hope you find something
to get passionate about, too.

242
00:19:34,290 --> 00:19:35,400
Yeah.

243
00:19:35,400 --> 00:19:38,200
