and I can't even take off!

257
00:21:41,050 --> 00:21:42,650
Hard luck.

258
00:21:43,790 --> 00:21:48,300
You wouldn't understand
what I have to go through.

259
00:21:48,300 --> 00:21:51,630
Not you, a CEO's son.

260
00:22:03,810 --> 00:22:05,680
Ryusuke...

261
00:22:05,680 --> 00:22:09,310
I'm going to form the ultimate band.

262
00:22:15,420 --> 00:22:17,080
So will I.

263
00:22:34,340 --> 00:22:36,280
Ryusuke-kun...

264
00:22:50,350 --> 00:22:52,460
Another minute

265
00:22:52,460 --> 00:22:55,430
Feelin' so fine

